[{"title":"翠声阁","author":"华龙翔","text":"云壑架书巢，庭户满空翠。\n空翠本非色，寻声复何在。\n渊明地弦琴，音在弦指外。\n独坐泯见闻，悠然自来会。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29424,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"恭寿先生于黄山深谷得杖一枝双茎盘曲节目轮囷首尾仍合并为一极离奇瑰异之观为作短歌","author":"华龙翔","text":"恭寿之杖一而两，夏后双龙落吾掌。\n恭寿之杖两而一，駏蛩相合几忘匹。\n骊珠百六节可数，追琢丁丁缺鬼斧。\n八年刊木遍神州，遗却黄山笑神禹。\n或言轩辕丹灶多遗薪，烬馀裂石蟠灵根。\n双丫竞茁不相让，欲劈未劈成轮囷。\n或言扶桑相纠老东溟，孙枝迸出仍骈颖。\n九乌长喙日夜啄，节目蚴虬堕残梗。\n我来欲把不敢触，恐是生蛟遭缚束。\n先生兴至时捉之，不借云軿驾双鹄。\n世途夔峡从崎嵚，扶携直过三山曲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29425,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"示仲孙应和时将北上","author":"华龙翔","text":"牖下嗟吾老，天涯忆汝单。\n因人知不易，行路敢辞难。\n有舌囊宜括，无鱼铗莫弹。\n饥驱为客早，惜别恨千端。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29426,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"上韩慕庐学士","author":"冯嗣京","text":"门分洛蜀路多岐，中立如公总不移。\n进退每关天下事，襟期独有圣明知。\n后堂长蓄公田酿，外国争求《贺雨》诗。\n莫漫抒辞颂功德，即论风雅亦吾师。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29427,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"庭梅","author":"宋匡业","text":"屋角冷云破，横空挺一枝。\n瘦应同鹤立，清似畏人知。\n写影惟凭月，传神不在诗。\n空山流水外，脉脉寄相思。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29428,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梅花","author":"宋匡业","text":"不染纷华别有神，乱山深处吐清新。\n旷如魏晋之间士，高比羲皇以上人。\n独立风前惟索笑，□能超外自归真。\n孤芳合与幽兰配，补入《离骚》一种春。","collection":"清","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29429,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋怀","author":"陆淹","text":"叶染深秋变早枫，轻云如黛月如弓。\n闲情??非关酒，倦骨支离不耐风。\n鱼悔尾赪思溟北，豕夸头白笑辽东。\n分明袖手看残弈，一角争差劫未终。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29430,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感怀和周铁门韵兼呈汝南公二首 其一","author":"江宏文","text":"九重宫阙隔云霓，昔梦曾依浴殿西。\n青琐几人犹索米，玄都千树莫留题。\n孤鸿出塞惊衰草，旅燕寻巢识旧栖。\n遥忆东山桥下路，秋风起处暮烟迷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29431,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感怀和周铁门韵兼呈汝南公二首 其二","author":"江宏文","text":"单衣短褐话当初，潦倒空悲岁月虚。\n击鼓谁云丞相怒，扫门自与舍人疏。\n陆沉渐觉风波老，生死还依骨肉居。\n三十三年多梦梦，此生犹在黑甜馀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29432,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"张睢阳庙","author":"陈叶筠","text":"丧乱逢天宝，江淮障一身。\n死甘为厉鬼，生岂负人伦。\n卞壸拳还握，苌弘血尚新。\n灵旗风卷处，犹似扫黄尘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29433,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浈阳峡","author":"陈叶筠","text":"一径入峡口，盘盘往复回。\n烟横两岸合，水划万峰开。\n命托长年手，魂惊乱石堆。\n前途望不极，何处越王台？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29434,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄许子逊","author":"陈叶筠","text":"不见南来双鲤鱼，风尘落拓感何如？\n偶过燕市悲歌地，曾上长沙痛哭书。\n芳草天涯分晓梦，暮云江树惜离居。\n春深何处堪凭吊，为我携尊酹望诸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29435,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"吊鹦鹉","author":"张琯","text":"雕笼悲越鸟，饮啄岂无情。\n本为多言误，翻怜一死轻。\n聪明应再世，文采毕今生。\n犹记南窗下，春风自唤名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29436,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"流莺词","author":"张嵩龄","text":"日暮听流莺，流莺啼不住。\n上苑春来又几时，深闺梦醒惊何处。\n初闻仿佛在东墙，又见随风出绿杨。\n睍睆枝头明似剪，绵蛮树底巧如簧。\n豪门争拥颜如玉，斗酒黄柑共相逐。\n宛转疑吹秦女箫，悠扬胜度吴娘曲。\n独有高楼粉黛人，年年夫婿怨飘零。\n鸳鸯独宿银屏冷，倚遍阑干不忍听。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29437,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南昌秋夜","author":"张嵩龄","text":"秋气频侵袂，空宵独掩扉。\n愁来心易醉，客久梦难归。\n灯焰床头短，虫声户外微。\n起看乌鹊影，三匝向南飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29438,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"芦花被","author":"程之鵔","text":"不并青绫一样看，只从江上借秋寒。\n覆时应共鸥群梦，卷处浑疑云影残。\n中夜月侵如有失，半醒霜凛觉无完。\n可知雪满江南路，借与袁安卧更安。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29439,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晓过平望","author":"程之鵔","text":"半夜帆开遇好风，平明平望一湖通。\n人家水气涵虚白，野树霜华染浅红。\n舵尾鱼虾吴市早，船头歌唱越吟工。\n前途烟雨楼边过，身入空蒙罨画中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29440,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"黄山","author":"程之鵔","text":"黄山三十六芙蓉，浴罢汤泉曳短筇。\n仙乐疑闻缑岭鹤，钵盂欲豢鼎湖龙。\n迷漫云气皆成海，穿穴峰头半是松。\n始信到来仍不信，天工理外若为容。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29441,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"抵金陵","author":"程之鵔","text":"晓风策策柳毵毵，帆影遥天破蔚蓝。\n一片伤心金粉地，落花时节到江南。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29442,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"表弟吴习之赠闽兰数种，今兰盛开而习之下世已复逾年，追感成咏","author":"席镐","text":"幽兰问何自，云是故人赉。\n故人今云亡，香草依然在。\n回忆十年来，周旋见情态。\n信宿娄江程，不阻水如带。\n芳菲表同臭，辱赠展相爱。\n一从入洛游，空教悬榻待。\n子本中林秀，扬扬远埃壒。\n俯视世俗文，无讥等自郐。\n凿枘两相违，谁欤加盼睐。\n人事既锄兰，天意复剪艾。\n可怜身后事，一一散馀叆。\n即此是故物，同心如晤对。\n年年及花期，思君一长慨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29443,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"除夕感怀亡弟湘北","author":"席镐","text":"去年当此夕，步屟过子庐。\n候门肃以入，列坐情怡愉。\n是时群从集，灯火荧前除。\n儿童绕我戏，捋髭牵衣裾。\n流光如转烛，景物与时俱。\n痛子竟长往，浮云变须臾。\n弟兄我七人，强半归丘墟。\n存者与子三，何堪返黄垆。\n在原爱由性，抚时感如初。\n百年洵难料，一岁行看徂。\n强壮子已矣，我衰当何如？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29444,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登穹窿绝顶望震泽同蒋香山作","author":"周孝学","text":"吴中富名山，穹窿独称长。\n郁律耸晴空，凭眺快无两。\n兹来值秋霁，疏翠揽盈掌。\n行行跻笠峰，孱颜俯群象。\n天平遥搢笏，卑犹成覆盎。\n云从岭下飞，飞鸟不能上。\n西南临具区，风涛相震荡。\n烟消螺髻浮，日落新镜晃。\n混合天水色，分坼吴越壤。\n呼吸凌青冥，啸歌脱尘鞅。\n何当寻赤松，相与出世网。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29445,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书牧斋集后二首 其一","author":"周孝学","text":"铜驼榛棘话酸辛，东涧盘旋剩旧身。\n碑碣大书杨左传，前朝公论借斯人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29446,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书牧斋集后二首 其二","author":"周孝学","text":"归老空门结净因，落花时复饯离人。\n出魔入佛超然处，欲浣朝衫一斗尘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29447,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"示两儿 其一","author":"李果","text":"初冬可读书，披帷对月影。\n困穷亦何常，天意默示警。\n所期在远大，忘此清夜永。\n经义纂孟荀，如汲得修绠。\n摛辞芟缪悠，百家足驰骋。\n蕴辉珠处渊，含英金在矿。\n世人竞目睫，欲语还如哽。\n但求寡悔尤，焉用名炳炳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29448,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"示两儿 其二","author":"李果","text":"马援廑闻过，柳玼重行己。\n吾家旧遗经，先德盛积累。\n黾勉无异营，颇识剥复理。\n中岁偶行游，致汝业渐弛。\n我无一顷田，经籍足耘耔。\n义理苟能通，出处有根柢。\n医药与货殖，困穷亦可倚。\n吾生少失学，垂老方知悔。\n展转力就衰，炳烛思晓起。\n努力爱景光，汝曹从此始。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29449,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"王将军剑歌","author":"李果","text":"神物铸成干将手，三尺苍龙半夜吼。\n七星吐焰烛银潢，魍魉潜藏白猿走。\n将军匹马来疏勒，手握寒光边塞黑。\n赠将海内有心人，风吹一片无情色。\n半行籀文不可认，血花点点荆卿恨。\n平生慷慨思报恩，尊前睚眦何须问。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29450,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭沈方舟三首 其一","author":"李果","text":"去冬送汝江上行，今年哭汝隔淮城。\n念汝寥落走四海，白头客死难为情。\n岂无当路可投足，苦心自许无人告，中夜辈歌恒刺促。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29451,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭沈方舟三首 其二","author":"李果","text":"黄河风高波涛恶，雨雪严冬古寺泊。\n来船去马不敢行，鹙鸧哀叫鱼龙跃。\n乡国迢遥渺何外，西隔金陵东浙渚，魂招不来奈何许。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29452,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭沈方舟三首 其三","author":"李果","text":"平生笔力足拒石，西河药亭争避席。\n故老诗成《海岳篇》，诸陵绝塞吟霜白。\n卅载同袍魂梦劳，相思落月临江皋，雁飞何处求其曹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29453,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀陈处士阳山","author":"李果","text":"老卧天池岭，寒松骨共存。\n人如陈仲子，诗是孟襄阳。\n有女尸蘋藻，无儿受缥缃。\n风流今已矣，忍更过书堂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29454,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泛艇木渎","author":"李果","text":"晨光初泛艇，流水枕清酣。\n风定晴湖渺，云生远岫含。\n梨花明月寺，芳草牧牛庵。\n多景灵岩近，乘春取次探。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29455,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚菊","author":"李果","text":"迎冬方吐艳，篱下竟谁看？\n岂敢伤迟暮，何妨历岁寒。\n孤怀原淡泊，独立未凋残。\n迟尔风前落，骚人佐夕餐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29456,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"从弟至二首 其一","author":"李果","text":"奔走怜吾弟，归来感慨多。\n风尘遭白眼，冰雪渡黄河。\n几作无家客，空为击楫歌。\n嗟余亦寥落，相对奈愁何？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29457,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"从弟至二首 其二","author":"李果","text":"失喜还疑梦，灯前认未真。\n流离二十载，惨淡一孤身。\n思子心如割，伤亲泪满巾。\n春秋虚祭扫，风木恨难伸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29458,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"关山月","author":"李果","text":"重关峻岭郁嵯峨，月色偏临绝塞多。\n万里寒生玄菟郡，三秋光射白狼河。\n黄榆风急传吹角，玉帐沙明照枕戈。\n最是空闺音信断，中宵愁听《陇头歌》。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29459,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"范文正公祠","author":"李果","text":"石笋排空山骨清，范公祠庙俨峥嵘。\n独从天下关忧乐，尚想胸中富甲兵。\n晚穗迎霜遗断陇，寒乌啼日傍丹楹。\n先皇银榜龙章在，红树阶前交映明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29460,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赵忠毅公铁如意歌","author":"韩骐","text":"妖蟆障日天地闭，代州戍卒性姜桂。\n手中刚铁尺二长，得共朱云剑争利。\n额图星斗背弓弯，罗纹细蹙银花斑。\n铭词奇倔篆文古，仿佛铸鼎昭神奸。\n百馀年来亲手泽，古今义愤通呼吸。\n想当边城起舞时，魑魅潜形鬼神泣。\n千秋正气座右存，物因人重珍瑶琨。\n指挥欲落崔魏胆，把玩许招杨左魂。\n呜呼明社久已屋，一器森芒夺人目。\n风前还吊宋遗民，击将如意西台哭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29461,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五人墓","author":"韩骐","text":"英风飒飒绕回塘，旧冢累累侠骨香。\n一击自同椎博浪，百身何异痛三良。\n头颅敢为忠臣惜，贩负能增党籍光。\n变例春秋墓前碣，先人特笔凛严霜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29462,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题赵承旨画兰","author":"韩骐","text":"花花叶叶带春风，自出王孙挥洒工。\n犹有遗民作《心史》，也将馀墨写幽丛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29463,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏阮步兵","author":"高日新","text":"长啸哭途穷，风流怀阮公。\n胸真多块垒，时定少英雄。\n白眼相看外，黄垆酣饮中。\n步兵堪吏隐，谁与测冥鸿？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29464,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"湘中弦","author":"马位","text":"水宫仙子湘江妃，芙蓉裳兮芰荷衣。\n张翠盖兮摇云旗，月光荡漾烟霏霏。\n采芳洲之蘅杜，弄明珠于澧浦，老鼍击鼓群蛟舞。\n洞庭波兮秋风，若有人兮苍茫中。\n九疑山青山梦绿，千年血泪啼斑竹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29465,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中秋夜","author":"马位","text":"清风扫云去无迹，碧空高挂银蟾光。\n鼎焚鸡舌向天拜，虱臣欲乞长生方。\n彩霞缥缈现金阙，鸾箫凤吹音琅琅。\n结璘授我两丸药，乃是兔捣千年之玄霜。\n调以华池漱神浆，金波透入丹田凉。\n吴刚斧声听不见，桂花压露凝秋香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29466,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鹦鹉","author":"马位","text":"吴音好鸟来陇西，翠衿红嘴架上栖。\n金屋花深隔娇女，纱窗如烟传笑语。\n银绦系胫不得飞，人前饮啄矜毛衣。\n园中歌舞晓携出，高挂绿杨迷一色。\n富家买尔巧舌声，那闻布谷催春耕。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29467,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏怀","author":"程樊","text":"兰为王者香，芬馥清风里。\n从来岩穴姿，不竞繁华美。\n龟以告犹亡，翟以炫采死。\n不善保厥初，受患每如此。\n莘野彼何人，三聘乃一起。\n如何志士躯，轻用徇知己。\n尘嚣多稠浊，云物俱不灵。\n所以山水间，往往有馀清。\n绪风发爽籁，幽谷舒芳英。\n草木觉生色，泉石俱空明。\n余怀本贞素，对之神益澄。\n宁静自致远，何为营浮名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29468,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"灌花","author":"允禧","text":"阶砌罗群芳，宛然如藻缋。\n照日相鲜新，临风各向背。\n盱睢忘忧子，淡焉此静对。\n荣谢寄流转，采色看迭代。\n休兹造化心，泽物恐不逮。\n园丁汲井栏，时时自灌溉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29469,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"樵歌","author":"允禧","text":"不闻人声，但闻斧声。\n寂寂岩响答，丁丁飞鸟惊。\n得柴换酒，醉归踏月山歌清。\n友木石，无衰荣。\n白云流水自朝暮，万山漠漠烟光青。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29470,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"月夜台上听友人弹琴","author":"允禧","text":"高台夜色深，月下闻清琴。\n能使座中客，俱生尘外心。\n石泉泻寒碧，霜竹折孤音。\n曲罢长天静，忘言一整襟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29471,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"村夜","author":"允禧","text":"旅舍灯犹在，村人语渐稀。\n山兼寒月静，叶带暗霜飞。\n厩马啮槽枥，邻鸡唱翠微。\n烟霞惹残梦，幽思满柴扉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29472,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"圆明园召看烟火恭纪","author":"允禧","text":"银汉星桥不动尘，斜飞火凤入勾陈。\n一声雷起地中蛰，万树花开天上春。\n太乙高楼灯似昼，未央前殿月移轮。\n君王行乐新年盛，先使恩光遍近臣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29473,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"双径","author":"允禧","text":"客去自掩关，林深鸟声静。\n徘徊夕阳中，秋烟淡孤影。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29474,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"邦均野寺","author":"允禧","text":"僧罢夕阳钟，客怀正孤绝。\n山鸟下空林，自啄茅檐雪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29475,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七夕","author":"允禧","text":"银河脉脉渡云軿，未拟穿针倚画屏。\n独向闲阶风露下，夜深无语拜双星。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29476,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"值宿闻乌夜啼","author":"弘曣","text":"值宿霜寒夜，蟾光瓦欲流。\n哑哑听乌语，历历数更筹。\n已傍龙楼稳，能稍砮矢忧。\n鸡竿应有兆，计日下皇州。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29477,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中秋无月","author":"德普","text":"谁道秋云薄，中宵掩桂轮。\n姮娥开镜懒，愁杀倚楼人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29478,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南西门外即目","author":"恒仁","text":"澄潭初月影微微，雨过凉生透葛衣。\n十里乱蝉风两岸，藕花香送钓船归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29479,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"塞外","author":"高述明","text":"云暗难分骑，沙深欲陷车。\n炎风初解冻，夏草渐萌芽。\n义勇心能一，尊严令不哗。\n楼兰犹未斩，那敢顾身家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29480,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"人日塞外马上口占","author":"高述明","text":"马蹄犹得蹋黄尘，马上犹吟塞外春。\n只谓此生掌近鬼，岂知今日又逢人。\n彩花剪细风光旧，沙海云开气象新。\n便拟题诗寄良友，草堂何处转伤神。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29481,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次韵奉和西林先生","author":"高斌","text":"忠信良非易，好学古所难。\n缅维颜夫子，得善斯拳拳。\n固守几于化，深造居乃安。\n哲人亦已远，勉矣士希贤。\n读书必自期，责己何敢宽。\n西林有美人，怅望青云端。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29482,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"荆卿墓","author":"塞尔赫","text":"身入虎狼国，心空百二州。\n壮怀生死外，易水古今流。\n白日淡将夕，行人去不留。\n墓傍谁击筑，寂寞野花秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29483,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"榆林道中","author":"康弘勋","text":"已过皋狼镇，行行秋色中。\n晓霜明佩剑，残月上雕弓。\n草带三边雪，雕盘万里风。\n客心似红日，常傍海云东。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29484,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雁门太守行","author":"鲍珍","text":"不见雁门高，安知太守骄。\n雁门高雁不可度，太守骄新不如故。\n堂堂复堂堂，汉家重循良。\n几人考上上，承恩奏明光。\n几人考下下，贬窜之他邦。\n五马煌煌二千石，河间姹女同朝夕。\n徒手相将拜路尘，清寒逼人太守嗔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29485,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江南","author":"李锴","text":"江水是弱水，久已沉羽毛。\n江水是江水，我岂无轻舠。\n中流双鸳鸯，唼波影凌乱。\n鸳鸯且莫飞，我有好针线。\n绣在合欢被，与汝日相见。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":29486,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]